*.sw?

# Build output left behind by the Tauri app that was deleted in 0.24.0. The
# rules for these lived in src-tauri/.gitignore, which went with it - so
# without this line 6.5 GB of Rust target/ turns up as untracked. Safe to
# delete from disk; the source is in the history under the legacy-tauri tag.
/src-tauri/
